  <body>
    <div id="root"><div role="region" aria-label="Notifications (F8)" tabindex="-1" style="pointer-events: none;"><ol tabindex="-1" class="fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]"></ol></div><div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col"><nav class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300 bg-cream/80 backdrop-blur-md"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8"><div class="flex items-center justify-between h-[4.5rem]"><a class="flex items-center gap-2.5 group" aria-label="SPACE — home" href="/"><span class="text-ink transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-60"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="flex-shrink-0"><rect x="0" y="0" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"></rect><rect x="7" y="0" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5"></rect><rect x="13" y="0" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.25"></rect><rect x="0" y="7" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5"></rect><rect x="7" y="7" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"></rect><rect x="13" y="7" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5"></rect><rect x="0" y="13" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.25"></rect><rect x="7" y="13" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5"></rect><rect x="13" y="13" width="5" height="5" rx="1" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9"></rect></svg></span><span class="text-ink font-display font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[1.0625rem] transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-60">SPACE</span></a><div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8"><a class="type-ui transition-colors duration-200 font-normal text-ink-muted hover:text-ink" href="/how-it-works/">How It Works</a><a class="type-ui transition-colors duration-200 font-medium text-ink" aria-current="page" href="/sell/">Sell</a><a class="type-ui transition-colors duration-200 font-normal text-ink-muted hover:text-ink" href="/calculator/">Calculator</a><a href="/apply/" class="type-ui px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-brand text-white hover:bg-brand-hover transition-colors duration-200">Request a free catalog review</a></div><button class="md:hidden p-2 -mr-1 text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="space-mobile-menu" aria-label="Open menu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu h-[18px] w-[18px]"><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></button></div></div><div id="space-mobile-menu" aria-hidden="true" inert="" class="md:hidden overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-out max-h-0 opacity-0"><div class="border-t border-black/[0.08] bg-cream/98 backdrop-blur-2xl px-6 py-5"><div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5"><a class="type-ui py-3.5 transition-colors font-normal text-ink-muted hover:text-ink" href="/how-it-works/">How It Works</a><a class="type-ui py-3.5 transition-colors font-medium text-ink" aria-current="page" href="/sell/">Sell</a><a class="type-ui py-3.5 transition-colors font-normal text-ink-muted hover:text-ink" href="/calculator/">Calculator</a><div class="pt-4 mt-3 border-t border-black/[0.08] space-y-2"><a href="/apply/" class="type-ui block text-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand text-white hover:bg-brand-hover transition-colors">Request a free catalog review</a></div></div></div></div></nav><section class="bg-cream pt-32 pb-24 md:pt-44 md:pb-32"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 text-center"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-faint uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Sell your catalog</p><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6 leading-[1.08] text-ink">What genre do you make?</h1><p class="text-xl text-ink-muted max-w-lg mx-auto font-light">Explore genre-specific valuation topics and prepare your income and rights evidence. The actual offer requires an individual review.</p></div></section><main class="flex-grow"><section class="bg-cream border-y border-black/5 py-16 md:py-20"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">New commercial genre expansion</p><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mb-4">Find guidance for your kind of catalog.</h2><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-ink-muted max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-8">Explore mood, house, techno, trance and crossover electronic catalogs. These pages help you prepare questions and evidence. Another genre is not a reason to rule yourself out: request an individual review.</p><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-black/10 p-6"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">House cluster</p><p class="text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed mb-2">House subgenres monetize through repeat-use contexts: fitness, nightlife, travel edits, and creator ecosystems.</p><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-1">Buyers prioritize rights-clean catalogs with instrumental/edit versions and stable playlist retention.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint mb-4">No fixed multiple: income, rights and terms require individual review.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-deep-house-catalog/">Deep House</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-melodic-house-catalog/">Melodic House</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-progressive-house-catalog/">Progressive House</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-tech-house-catalog/">Tech House</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-afro-house-catalog/">Afro House</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-organic-house-catalog/">Organic House</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-electro-house-catalog/">Electro House</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-future-house-catalog/">Future House</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-bass-house-catalog/">Bass House</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-garage-house-catalog/">Garage House</a></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-black/10 p-6"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Electronic cluster</p><p class="text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed mb-2">Electronic catalogs perform when they are deployable across gaming, creator content, and sync-adjacent campaign edits.</p><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-1">Depth across substyles plus metadata quality (BPM/key/mood) usually increases buyer confidence.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint mb-4">No fixed multiple: income, rights and terms require individual review.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-uk-garage-catalog/">UK Garage</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-drum-and-bass-catalog/">Drum and Bass</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-techno-catalog/">Techno</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-trance-catalog/">Trance</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-electronica-catalog/">Electronica</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-indie-dance-catalog/">Indie Dance</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-dance-pop-catalog/">Dance Pop</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-synthwave-catalog/">Synthwave</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-chillout-catalog/">Chillout</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-downtempo-catalog/">Downtempo</a><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-breakbeat-catalog/">Breakbeat</a></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-black/10 p-6"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Techno cluster</p><p class="text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed mb-2">Techno and melodic techno catalogs win on club utility, event media, and long-tail niche audience loyalty.</p><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-1">Buyers look for coherent sonic identity and clear sample/topline ownership across the full chain.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint mb-4">No fixed multiple: income, rights and terms require individual review.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-melodic-techno-catalog/">Melodic Techno</a></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-black/10 p-6"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Trance cluster</p><p class="text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed mb-2">Trance subgenres remain commercially relevant through legacy communities, festivals, and creator-led visual content.</p><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-1">Catalogs with consistent release quality and licensing-ready versions usually negotiate faster.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint mb-4">No fixed multiple: income, rights and terms require individual review.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="text-xs rounded-full bg-cream px-3 py-1.5 text-ink hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors" href="/sell/sell-psytrance-catalog/">Psytrance</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">Broad commercial genres</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-electronic-music-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Electronic</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Electronic Catalogs Are Expanding Beyond Festival Cycles</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Streaming, gaming, creator content, and sync are creating broader buyer demand for electronic rights libraries.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify and Apple Music for recurring playlist traffic</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Gaming and esports highlight content</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-house-music-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">House</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">House Music Catalogs Have Durable Utility and Repeat Demand</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">From clubs to fitness content and branded edits, house tracks deliver repeatable licensing and streaming value.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify house playlists and algorithmic radio</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Workout and fitness classes</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-tropical-house-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Tropical House</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Tropical House Keeps Strong Commercial Replay Value</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Warm melodic dance catalogs continue to perform in travel, lifestyle, and creator-led content ecosystems.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify mood and summer/travel playlist ecosystems</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Travel and tourism campaigns</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></section><section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">Mood &amp; functional genres</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-ambient-music-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Ambient</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Your Ambient Catalog Has Never Been Worth More</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Wellness apps, meditation platforms, and corporate environments are driving unprecedented demand for atmospheric and textural music rights. Find out what yours are worth.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify — dominant for ambient through editorial playlists like "Ambient Relaxation," "Deep Focus," and "Peaceful Piano"</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Wellness and meditation apps (Calm, Headspace, Insight Timer, Balance)</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-lo-fi-beats-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Lo-Fi</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Turn Your Lo-Fi Beats Into a Life-Changing Payout</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Study playlists, content creators, and retail brands are fueling massive demand for lo-fi hip-hop catalogs. Discover what your beats are worth today.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify — the primary driver of lo-fi streams, with massive editorial playlist support and strong algorithmic discovery</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Study and productivity apps (Forest, Todoist, Focus Keeper, Brain.fm)</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-meditation-music-rights/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Meditation</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Meditation Music Rights Are Commanding Premium Valuations</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">The $15B+ wellness app market is hungry for licensed meditation music. Your guided meditation backgrounds and sound healing recordings could be your most valuable financial asset.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Calm — the largest meditation app by revenue, actively licensing meditation music for sleep stories, daily meditations, and soundscapes</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Meditation and mindfulness apps (Calm, Headspace, Insight Timer, Balance, Ten Percent Happier)</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-focus-music-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Focus</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Focus Music Is the Soundtrack to the Remote Work Revolution</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Productivity apps, co-working spaces, and educational platforms are driving surging demand for concentration and deep work music. Your catalog could be worth more than you think.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify — dominant platform for focus music discovery through editorial playlists like "Deep Focus," "Brain Food," and "Coding Mode"</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Productivity and focus apps (Brain.fm, Focus@Will, Endel, Noisli)</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-nature-soundscape-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Nature Soundscapes</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Premium Nature Soundscapes Are in High Demand</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Sleep apps, hotel chains, and wellness brands are paying top dollar for high-quality field recordings and environmental soundscapes. Learn what your catalog is worth.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify — nature and sleep playlists drive massive stream counts from extended overnight listening sessions</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Sleep and white noise apps (Sleep Cycle, Rain Rain, Noisli, Sleepiest, myNoise)</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-chillhop-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Chillhop</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Chillhop Has Evolved From a Niche to a Lifestyle Brand Powerhouse</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Coffee shops, lifestyle brands, and content creators are paying premium rates for curated chillhop catalogs. Find out what your jazz-hop beats are worth.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify — major editorial support through playlists like "Jazz Vibes," "Chillhop Essentials," and "Mellow Beats"</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Coffee shop chains and independent cafés seeking licensed in-store playlists</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-study-beats-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Study Beats</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Study Beats Are Powering a Billion-Stream Playlist Economy</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Millions of students stream study beats daily, and exam seasons create predictable revenue spikes that buyers love. See what your study music catalog is worth.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify — the dominant platform for study music, with massive editorial playlist support and algorithmic study music discovery</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Educational technology platforms (Coursera, Khan Academy, Quizlet, Anki)</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-sleep-music-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Sleep Music</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Sleep Music Sits at the Center of a $100 Billion Market</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Sleep apps, smart mattress brands, and wellness platforms are investing heavily in licensed sleep audio. Your catalog could be your most valuable asset.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify — sleep playlists are among the platform's highest-engagement categories, with "Sleep" exceeding 7 million followers</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Sleep and meditation apps (Calm, Headspace, BetterSleep, Pzizz, Sleep Cycle, Sleepiest)</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-wellness-music-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Wellness</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Wellness Music Is a Core Asset in a $60 Billion Industry</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Corporate wellness programs, luxury spas, and yoga platforms are driving sustained demand for licensed therapeutic and spa music. Discover your catalog's true value.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify — strong performance in wellness, spa, and yoga editorial playlists with high listener engagement</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Luxury spa chains and wellness resorts (Six Senses, Aman, ESPA, Banyan Tree, Canyon Ranch)</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream-dark transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-new-age-music-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">New Age</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">New Age Music Is Experiencing a Generational Value Resurgence</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Sound healing sessions, yoga studios, and holistic wellness brands are creating renewed demand for new age and world fusion catalogs. Find out what yours is worth today.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Spotify — dedicated new age and world music editorial playlists with loyal, high-value listener demographics</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Sound healing practitioners and crystal bowl ceremony facilitators</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></section><section class="bg-cream py-20 md:py-28"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">Specialized genres</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-drone-music-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Drone</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Drone Music Is Quietly Becoming a High-Value Sync Asset</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Art installations, film composers, and experimental theater companies are actively seeking sustained-tone and drone compositions. Discover what your catalog is worth.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Bandcamp — the primary discovery and direct-sales platform for experimental and drone music, with a dedicated and engaged buyer community</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Film and television scoring — tension, atmosphere, and psychological sequences</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-cinematic-ambient-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Cinematic Ambient</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Cinematic Ambient Music Commands the Highest Multiples in Functional Music</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Film trailers, documentary series, AAA video games, and streaming platforms are paying premium rates for atmospheric, emotionally resonant music. Your catalog could be a top-tier sync asset.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-1"><span class="text-ink-muted">Demand:</span> Sync licensing agencies (Musicbed, Artlist, Marmoset, Musicbed) — primary distribution channels for cinematic ambient in commercial contexts</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-faint leading-relaxed mb-5"><span class="text-ink-muted">Use-case:</span> Film and television scoring placements (Netflix, Apple TV+, HBO, Amazon, BBC)</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">Individually reviewed</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-white/60 group-hover:text-ink-faint group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></a><a class="group bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 hover:bg-cream transition-colors duration-200" href="/sell/sell-deep-house-catalog/"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Deep House</p><h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2 leading-snug">Deep House Catalogs Are Becoming High-Utility Rights Assets</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-5">Buyer demand is rising for deep house catalogs